<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "k_c, the Jacobian, the sweep, and the ablation are each a named function. The Lean file proves the integer trace sign, not the floating-point integrator. Lean was not executed here; no lean binary was on the PATH." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script implements Schnakenberg kinetics and the standard critical-wavenumber formula, with (a, b, gamma, d) = (0.14, 0.76, 10, 18), periodic boundaries, and explicit Euler. The 206 nm result is the length unit, not an extra fitted mode. It is not a derivation of that wavelength from a measured SrSO4 diffusivity." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 78/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "In-sample Pearson r = 0.9991 on six wavelengths, with p from scipy.stats.pearsonr. RMSE = 43.30 nm is large relative to 206 nm and is a systematic long shift, not noise. First-render radial-profile r = 0.548. Orientation KS = 0.113. Foreground fraction 0.501 versus 0.352 on the drawing. n = 1 plate. Self-identical value==reference metrics are not used." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
