<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 76/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Side by side, the first render is a cream-ground golden disk with radial spines, which is the plate's layout, not its barbed central star. Feature-space cv_sim_similarity on that GIF was 90.2 (12 frames, 960x680). That score is not a claim that the engraving and the drawing match spine for spine. The specimen is a genus plate, not a photo of A. pellucida." ;
